@startuml
title Search Vocabulary Sequence (/vocabulary and /api/admin/words)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary Search UI" as VocabularyUi
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as FeController
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as AdminWordsController
control "TopicsController\n(BE API)" as TopicsController
entity "WordListItem\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordListDto
entity "TopicSummary\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeTopicSummaryDto
entity "AdminWordQueryRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as BeWordQueryDto
entity "AdminWordListItemResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeWordListDto
entity "TopicSummaryResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeTopicSummaryDto
control "IWordAdminService" as IWordAdminService
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "ITopicReadService" as ITopicReadService
control "TopicReadService" as TopicService
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordSense" as WordSenseEntity
entity "WordTopic" as WordTopicEntity
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
control "IWordAdminRepository" as IWordAdminRepository
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
control "ITopicReadRepository" as ITopicReadRepository
control "TopicReadRepository" as TopicRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over VocabularyUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard UI file exists: Views/Vocabulary/Index.cshtml.
FE controller exists: VocabularyController.
BE controllers exist: AdminWordsController and TopicsController.
Dashboard route is GET /vocabulary with q, cefr, topicId, status,
wordType, includeDeleted, page, limit, sortBy and sortDirection.
VocaNovaApiClient calls GET /api/admin/words and GET /api/topics.
FE response DTOs exist: WordListItem and TopicSummary.
BE request DTO exists: AdminWordQueryRequest.
BE response DTOs exist: AdminWordListItemResponse and TopicSummaryResponse.
Entities exist: Word, WordSense, WordTopic and Topic.
Interfaces used in code: IWordAdminService, ITopicReadService, IWordAdminRepository,
  ITopicReadRepository.
end note

Admin -> VocabularyUi: Enter search/filter values
Admin -> VocabularyUi: Submit search
VocabularyUi -> FeController: GET /vocabulary\nquery/filter/sort/page
FeController -> FeController: Normalize page, limit,\nsort and filters

FeController -> AdminWordsController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordsAsync\nGET /api/admin/words
AdminWordsController -> BeWordQueryDto: Bind query string
BeWordQueryDto --> AdminWordsController: AdminWordQueryRequest
AdminWordsController -> AdminWordsController: Check admin authorization
AdminWordsController -> IWordAdminService: SearchAsync(query)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: SearchAsync(query)
WordService -> IWordAdminService: Validate page, limit,\nCEFR, status and sort
IWordAdminService -> WordService: Validate page, limit,\nCEFR, status and sort

alt Query validation fails
    WordService --> AdminWordsController: Validation failure
    AdminWordsController --> FeController: HTTP 400 error
    FeController --> VocabularyUi: Show empty list or error
else Query validation success
    WordService -> IWordAdminService: Normalize q, CEFR,\nstatus, wordType and sort
    IWordAdminService -> WordService: Normalize q, CEFR,\nstatus, wordType and sort
    WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: SearchAsync(normalized query)
    IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: SearchAsync(normalized query)
    WordRepository -> DbContext: Build word search query
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM words\nwith filters
    MySQL --> DbContext: Total item count
    DbContext -> WordEntity: Count matching Word rows
    WordEntity --> DbContext: Total item count

    WordRepository -> DbContext: Query paged word list
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words with senses\nand topics
    MySQL --> DbContext: Word list rows
    DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word rows
    DbContext -> WordSenseEntity: Read primary WordSense
    DbContext -> WordTopicEntity: Read WordTopic links
    DbContext -> TopicEntity: Read Topic rows
    WordEntity --> DbContext: Word rows
    WordSenseEntity --> DbContext: Primary meaning\nand word type
    WordTopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic links
    TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic data
    DbContext --> WordRepository: Paged word result
    WordRepository --> WordService: Paged words
    WordService --> AdminWordsController: Search result
    AdminWordsController -> BeWordListDto: Create AdminWordListItemResponse list
    BeWordListDto --> AdminWordsController: AdminWordListItemResponse list
    AdminWordsController -> FeWordListDto: HTTP 200 OK\npaged AdminWordListItemResponse JSON
    FeWordListDto --> FeController: WordListItem list
end

FeController -> TopicsController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetTopicsAsync\nGET /api/topics
TopicsController -> ITopicReadService: GetTopicsAsync()
ITopicReadService -> TopicService: GetTopicsAsync()
TopicService -> ITopicReadRepository: GetTopicsAsync()
ITopicReadRepository -> TopicRepository: GetTopicsAsync()
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Query topics
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Topic rows
DbContext -> TopicEntity: Read Topic rows
TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic summaries
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Topic summaries
TopicRepository --> TopicService: Topic summaries
TopicService --> TopicsController: Topic result
TopicsController -> BeTopicSummaryDto: Create TopicSummaryResponse list
BeTopicSummaryDto --> TopicsController: TopicSummaryResponse list
TopicsController -> FeTopicSummaryDto: HTTP 200 OK\nTopicSummaryResponse JSON
FeTopicSummaryDto --> FeController: TopicSummary list

FeController -> FeController: Build VocabularyListViewModel
FeController --> VocabularyUi: Show search results

@enduml
